The full text of the applicable licenses can be found in the `LICENSES/`
directory.


Good-Faith Relicensing Statement
================================

Following the MAME 0.172 relicensing effort, the AdvanceMAME and AdvanceMESS
codebases have been audited against the official MAME relicensing records.
The complete file-by-file license audit, copyright attribution mapping, and
replacement plans are documented in:

    support/relicense/ADVANCEMAME_RELICENSE_AUDIT.md
    support/relicense/ADVANCEMESS_RELICENSE_AUDIT.md

All source files and drivers originally covered by the legacy non-commercial
MAME/MESS license whose copyright holders declined or could not be reached for
GPL-compatible relicensing have been removed or replaced with clean,
GPL-compatible rewrites backported from MAME.

This relicensing and code replacement was carried out in good faith to ensure
full compliance with the GNU General Public License. If you are a copyright
holder and believe that any portion of your code included in AdvanceMAME or
AdvanceMESS was not properly relicensed under a GPL-compatible license or has
been attributed incorrectly, please contact the project maintainer or open an
issue on the project repository. Any non-GPL-compatible code identified will be
promptly removed or replaced with a clean GPL-compatible backport from MAME.


